Maa Sadqe Maa Wari Akber Tum Na Aaye<br>
Ro-Ro Aarz Guzari Akbar Tum Na Aaye<br>
<br>
Bara Gale Bandhe Hai Adu Ne Ek Rasan Me<br>
Kuchh Ki Hai Tayyari Akber Tum Na Aaye<br>
<br>
Kab Tak Apne muh Ko Chupaongi Balon Se<br>
Chadar Legaye Nari Akber Tum Na Aaye<br>
<br>
Chin Liye zalim Ne Sakina Ke Gouhar Tak<br>
Loot Machi Hai Sari Akber Tum Na Aaye<br>
<br>
Tum Bin mangti Rehti Hu Marne Ki Duaen<br>
Listh Ladi Hai Bhari Akber Tum Na Aaye<br>
<br>
Beta Tumari Raha Guzar Me Chalte Chalte<br>
Bujh-Gayi Aankh Hamari Akber Tum Na Aaye<br>
<br>
Chaha Hai Usne Tho Tumhe Betoun Se Zyada<br>
Aye Zainab Dukyari Akber Tum Na Aaye<br>
<br>
Shaam-e- Ghariba Me Baba Ka Pursa Dene<br>
Aayi Ali Ki Sawari Akber Tum Na Aaye<br>
<br>
Din Bhar Baithi Rahti Hai Raha Guzar Me<br>
Kya Kare Sugra Bechari Akber Tum Na Aaye<br>
<br>
Ab Bhi Sarosh Aati Hai Yahi Laila Ki Sadaye<br>
Sun Kar Ki Zaari Akber Tum Na Aaye